otm_schema.json is the JSON schema of the Open Threat Model (OTM) 0.2.0, copied unchanged from
https://github.com/iriusrisk/OpenThreatModel/blob/c88c5a7b4115f0f025e28d5682a2b0d790b389e4/otm_schema.json

The schema states in its "$comment" that it is published under the Apache License 2.0,
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0. The rest of that repository, the specification
text and examples, is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0 and is not copied here.

This copy is taken from the main branch rather than the 0.2.0 tag: the tagged file lacks the
"items" level of the representations and assets arrays, so it does not describe the assets that
the specification defines. Both declare the version 0.2.0.

Threagile only uses the schema in tests, to validate the OTM files it writes.
